			<zone xml:id="p2z4-0" points="1027,1835 1088,1858 1379,1800 1598,1815 1598,1747 1520,1732 1395,1760 1334,1743 1242,1777 1101,1739 1027,1745">1032,1806 1060,1800 1088,1798 1117,1797 1145,1797 1174,1797 1202,1797 1230,1795 1259,1795 1287,1797 1316,1797 1344,1797 1372,1797 1401,1797 1429,1797 1458,1797 1486,1797 1514,1797 1543,1797 1571,1799 1600,1803</zone>
